{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "n-summary",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 恒定电流公式汇总\n\n电流 → 欧姆定律 → 焦耳定律 → 电源与电动势",
			"x": 340,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "n-current",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电流**\n\n$$I = \\frac{dq}{dt} = nqSv_d$$\n\n$$\\vec{J} = nq\\vec{v}_d$$\n\n$$\\nabla\\cdot\\vec{J} = -\\frac{\\partial\\rho}{\\partial t}$$",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "n-resistance",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**欧姆定律 & 电阻**\n\n$$U = IR$$\n\n$$\\vec{J} = \\sigma\\vec{E}$$\n\n$$R = \\rho\\frac{l}{S}$$",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 230
		},
		{
			"id": "n-joule",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**焦耳定律**\n\n$$P = UI = I^2R$$\n\n$$Q = I^2Rt$$\n\n$$dP = \\vec{J}\\cdot\\vec{E}$$",
			"x": 380,
			"y": 490,
			"width": 310,
			"height": 220
		},
		{
			"id": "n-emf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**电源与电动势**\n\n$$\\mathcal{E} = \\oint \\vec{E}_k\\cdot d\\vec{l}$$\n\n$$U = \\mathcal{E} - Ir$$",
			"x": 730,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 180
		}
	],
	"edges": [
		{
			"id": "e1",
			"fromNode": "n-current",
			"fromSide": "right",
			"toNode": "n-resistance",
			"toSide": "left",
			"label": "J → J = σE"
		},
		{
			"id": "e2",
			"fromNode": "n-resistance",
			"fromSide": "bottom",
			"toNode": "n-joule",
			"toSide": "top",
			"label": "P = I²R"
		},
		{
